cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, dataset, or the measurements it contains,
  please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
title: >-
  Why Additive Elliptic-Curve Set Commitments Do Not Help Ethereum Plasma:
  A Negative Result from an End-to-End UTXO Implementation
abstract: >-
  Frozen measurement datasets, L1 transaction receipts, and the complete
  analysis pipeline behind the paper. Two datasets are archived and are
  never merged: 20260916-161911-949ccf7 (E1 commitment cost, E2
  per-operation gas, E4 exploit tests) and 20260917-091033-d4842b9 (E3
  hot-path throughput, re-run with one Anvil instance per run to remove
  chain size as a confound). Throughput is reported as hot-path ops/s,
  not TPS.
